[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9799.99, "timestamp": "02:43:19", "text": "ゲームでは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9801.99, "timestamp": "02:43:21", "text": "疑問符や感嘆符のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9803.91, "timestamp": "02:43:23", "text": "このような跡。読んでみたい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9807.03, "timestamp": "02:43:27", "text": "すべての機能を読む機能など、唯一の機能または"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9809.429, "timestamp": "02:43:29", "text": "何か。それはとても役に立つでしょう、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9813.11, "timestamp": "02:43:33", "text": "あなたは思う？好きになるのは本当に大変だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9816.19, "timestamp": "02:43:36", "text": "手動ですべての"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9827.51, "timestamp": "02:43:47", "text": "Apexでそれが始まったのは嬉しい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9831.349, "timestamp": "02:43:51", "text": "そのゲームは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9834.03, "timestamp": "02:43:54", "text": "感嘆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9837.389, "timestamp": "02:43:57", "text": "もの。よし、才能ポイントが1つある。"}]